[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6483.51, "timestamp": "01:48:03", "text": "当然。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6485.83, "timestamp": "01:48:05", "text": "然后那男人像舔舐一样舔着他们的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6487.669, "timestamp": "01:48:07", "text": "小嘴唇，就像你以为的那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6489.83, "timestamp": "01:48:09", "text": "蜱虫不肯吃东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6494.229, "timestamp": "01:48:14", "text": "我希望你不要吃任何我们没吃的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6500.629, "timestamp": "01:48:20", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6502.87, "timestamp": "01:48:22", "text": "我只是想说，也许我们可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6505.03, "timestamp": "01:48:25", "text": "试着把这种黑色液体涂在上面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6508.07, "timestamp": "01:48:28", "text": "那边的肉块，看看能不能弄到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6509.189, "timestamp": "01:48:29", "text": "扔掉它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6511.35, "timestamp": "01:48:31", "text": "是的，Tick 是这么说的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6513.51, "timestamp": "01:48:33", "text": "是的，我知道。这就是我为什么说“而且”的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6514.55, "timestamp": "01:48:34", "text": "本来想说的是，“是啊，这……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6516.07, "timestamp": "01:48:36", "text": "打钩。这是你的想法。我只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6517.43, "timestamp": "01:48:37", "text": "转达它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6518.95, "timestamp": "01:48:38", "text": "是的。是的。不，它其实很不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6520.709, "timestamp": "01:48:40", "text": "这个想法是因为没人应该会听到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6525.59, "timestamp": "01:48:45", "text": "如果你们想解散所有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6528.229, "timestamp": "01:48:48", "text": "我想，用尸体清理或许有助于摆脱它们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6529.43, "timestamp": "01:48:49", "text": "它的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6529.99, "timestamp": "01:48:49", "text": "实际上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6531.51, "timestamp": "01:48:51", "text": "不，我的意思是，就像我们可以像倒水一样倒水一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6533.35, "timestamp": "01:48:53", "text": "肉质上的小瓶黑色液体"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6535.51, "timestamp": "01:48:55", "text": "东西，希望这样能把它清除掉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6537.35, "timestamp": "01:48:57", "text": "那间巨大的肉体房间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6539.109, "timestamp": "01:48:59", "text": "我们可以试试。我们当然可以"}]